# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this, the Windows CI runner checks the tree out with CRLF while Linux
# and macOS use LF, so `prettier . --check` passes on two legs of the matrix and
# fails on the third with every file listed. `text=auto` still lets Git detect
# and leave binary files alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
